                  <div><span class="ui-kit-company-card__logo ui-kit-company-card__logo--generic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 21V7l8-4 8 4v14M8 10h2m4 0h2m-8 4h2m4 0h2M9 21v-3h6v3"></path></svg></span><small>Безопасная заглушка</small></div>
                </div>
